    a: "Line by line, using each line's own driver rather than doubling everything. Take revenue from the current rent roll, since rents and occupancy may have moved. Use the actual annual bill for taxes and insurance, which are often paid in lumps. Use a full prior year for seasonal lines like utilities and snow removal. Then strip out one-time items.",
